+  // apklayer patch (0075): the store-load fence of DMB ISH and STLR. On AMD: LOCK NOTL of this thread's private ThreadState word (a
+  // locked RMW orders earlier stores before later loads like MFENCE for ordinary memory; NOT leaves EFLAGS alone and needs no
